// This capacity requires a transformation mechanism: a prior moment M
// and an emergent moment M', where M' is what M becomes.
// M' = M may hold (no change occurs), but the transformation
// M -> M' must be defined.
//
// Derives from: theory.moment (transformation operates on moments)
  """
}
